&P258481 = BE 06/1, 041 
#atf: lang akk 
@tablet 
@obverse 
1. _3(disz) dumu-me_ ri-isz-a-bi 
#tr.ts: šalāštum mārū rīš-abī
#tr.en: Three: the sons of Rīš-abī;
2. _3(disz) dumu-me_ ma-an-nu-um-ba-lum-{d}utu 
#tr.ts: šalāštum mārū mannum-bālum-šamaš
#tr.en: three: the sons of Mannum-bālum-šamaš
3. u3 ip-qa2-tum _dumu_ pa-ha-lu-um 
#tr.ts: u ipqatum mār paḫa(l)lum
#tr.en: and Ipqatum son of Paḫallum;
4. _3(disz)_ {d}utu-na-s,i-ir _dumu_ i3-li2-i-te-e 
#tr.ts: šalāštum šamaš-nāṣir mār ilī-itê
#tr.en: three: Šamaš-nāṣir, son of Ilī-itê,
5. u3 i-ni-ib-{d}utu 
#tr.ts: u inib-šamaš
#tr.en: and Inib-šamaš;
6. _1(disz) lu2-hun-ga2_ sza {d}marduk-mu-sza-lim 
#tr.ts: ištēn agrum ša marduk-muša(l)lim
#tr.en: one hireling of Marduk-mušallim;
7. _1(disz) lu2-hun-ga2_ i-din-{d}la-ga-ma-al 
#tr.ts: ištēn agrum i(d)din-lāgamāl
#tr.en: one hireling, Iddin-lāgamāl,
8. sza a-di-du-um 
#tr.ts: ša adidum
#tr.en: of Adidum.
9. _nam-u-disz_ {d}suen-na-di-in#-[szu-mi] 
#tr.ts: ištēššeret sîn-nādin-šumi
#tr.en: The eleven (team) of Nādin-šumi
10. u3 {d}utu-na-s,ir# 
#tr.ts: u šamaš-nāṣir
#tr.en: and Šamaš-nāṣir.
